{"unsubscribe action raises NoMethodError when TopicUser.find_by returns nil for user/topic combination, causing 500 error": 0.9561430215835571, "Typo in property name 'stopNotificiations' (should be 'stopNotifications') hurts maintainability": 0.3024592995643616, "XSS vulnerability: unsubscribe template renders {{{stopNotificiationsText}}} (triple-stash/unescaped) which interpolates user-controlled model.fancyTitle into HTML, allowing malicious topic titles to inject arbitrary HTML/JS": 0.9288370609283447, "unsubscribe action raises error when TopicUser exists but notification_level column is NULL, as comparing nil to Integer fails": 0.28593161702156067, "MessageBuilder's add_unsubscribe_link uses I18n translation requiring unsubscribe_url interpolation but doesn't assert template_args includes :unsubscribe_url, causing I18n::MissingInterpolationArgument exception and email delivery failures": 0.852907657623291, "List-Unsubscribe header only points to general user preferences URL, not the per-topic unsubscribe URL included in email body, causing inconsistency for mail clients using one-click unsubscribe": 0.7986071109771729}